{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MatomoDimensions","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Matomo numbers the custom dimensions of a site as they are made, in its settings (Administration,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Websites, Custom Dimensions), and reads a request’s "},{"code":"dimension3","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" as the value of dimension 3, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the mapping comes from the app:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let dimensions: MatomoDimensions = [\"plan\": 1, \"seats\": 2]"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A property is mapped by its name, the same in every event of the plan that has it. A property"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no mapping names is never sent, and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoDimensions\/unmappedProperties(in:)"},{"type":"text","text":" lists those of a plan, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the encoder logs once when it is made."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A literal doesn’t check anything, so it can’t fail: the destination’s factory checks the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mapping against the plan, and throws "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoSetupError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for a dimension ID below 1, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property mapped twice, a property no event of the plan has, a property that is "},{"type":"codeVo